5.11.10 Security and Access

Access to the MHMR Data Processing Framework should be managed using role-based access control (RBAC). Users should be granted permissions based on their responsibilities.

Role	Responsibilities
Developer	Develop and maintain notebooks, perform testing, and implement enhancements.
Data Engineer	Monitor pipeline executions, troubleshoot issues, and support production processing.
Administrator	Manage Lakehouse objects, workspace configurations, security, and deployment activities.
Business User	Read-only access to reporting datasets and approved downstream outputs.

Sensitive operational log tables should be accessible only to authorized technical users.
